= Glossary

The words this book uses in a fixed sense, collected from the places where the
chapters define them: the two entropies kept apart, information against
knowledge, and the four words for what a programmer makes -- software, source
code, program, process. The industry uses code, program, software and
application interchangeably; this book does not.
